      <title>虛假：網傳香港永久性居民申請設「加分制」說法不實 | annie lab</title>
      <link>https://annielab.org/2026/04/14/%e8%99%9b%e5%81%87%ef%bc%9a%e7%b6%b2%e5%82%b3%e9%a6%99%e6%b8%af%e6%b0%b8%e5%b1%85%e7%94%b3%e8%ab%8b%e8%a8%ad%e3%80%8c%e5%8a%a0%e5%88%86%e5%88%b6%e3%80%8d%e8%aa%aa%e6%b3%95%e4%b8%8d%e5%af%a6/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=%25e8%2599%259b%25e5%2581%2587%25ef%25bc%259a%25e7%25b6%25b2%25e5%2582%25b3%25e9%25a6%2599%25e6%25b8%25af%25e6%25b0%25b8%25e5%25b1%2585%25e7%2594%25b3%25e8%25ab%258b%25e8%25a8%25ad%25e3%2580%258c%25e5%258a%25a0%25e5%2588%2586%25e5%2588%25b6%25e3%2580%258d%25e8%25aa%25aa%25e6%25b3%2595%25e4%25b8%258d%25e5%25af%25a6</link>
      <description>經查，《入境條例》和申請成為永久性居民的相關文件並無列出加分項目；入境處處理申請時會審視申請人離港原因、通常居所及工作等居留情況。</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://annielab.org/2026/04/14/%e8%99%9b%e5%81%87%ef%bc%9a%e7%b6%b2%e5%82%b3%e9%a6%99%e6%b8%af%e6%b0%b8%e5%b1%85%e7%94%b3%e8%ab%8b%e8%a8%ad%e3%80%8c%e5%8a%a0%e5%88%86%e5%88%b6%e3%80%8d%e8%aa%aa%e6%b3%95%e4%b8%8d%e5%af%a6/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=%25e8%2599%259b%25e5%2581%2587%25ef%25bc%259a%25e7%25b6%25b2%25e5%2582%25b3%25e9%25a6%2599%25e6%25b8%25af%25e6%25b0%25b8%25e5%25b1%2585%25e7%2594%25b3%25e8%25ab%258b%25e8%25a8%25ad%25e3%2580%258c%25e5%258a%25a0%25e5%2588%2586%25e5%2588%25b6%25e3%2580%258d%25e8%25aa%25aa%25e6%25b3%2595%25e4%25b8%258d%25e5%25af%25a6</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://annielab.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/20260202_HKPRPointsTC_1.png" length="0" type="image/png"/>
